How to get started:
• Start with 4 request lines
• Keep a pointer to the next priority
• Grant the next active requester
• Rotate pointer after every grant
• Add test cases with bursts and starvation checks

6. Implement a simple CPU core
No need for complexity. A few instructions are enough.

